[en.DECISION_C01_ANGRY_EXP]
Harness the Fury

[en.DECISION_C01_ANGRY_EXP_desc]
Channel Cozy Glow's anger into a burst of ideological zeal, industrial efficiency, and logistical discipline. The Empire will surge forward, even as its stability suffers.

[zh.DECISION_C01_ANGRY_EXP]
驾驭怒火

[zh.DECISION_C01_ANGRY_EXP_desc]
将和煦光流的怒火化为意识形态狂热、工业效率与后勤纪律。帝国将加速前进，即使这会损害国家稳定。
